{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "渴", "id": "渴"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "飢", "id": "飢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "天", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 4.07753744390572, "source": "害", "target": "渴"}, {"weight": 3.7898553714539385, "source": "害", "target": "飢"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "害", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 3.7898553714539385, "source": "飢", "target": "渴"}, {"weight": 2.180417459019838, "source": "飢", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.5370924029585704, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "智", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 3.5667118201397288, "source": "智", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 3.3843902633457743, "source": "智", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 3.7898553714539385, "source": "智", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 3.096708190893993, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "性", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "性", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 1.5926307941177191, "source": "性", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "性", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.7453329337305156, "source": "性", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "性", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.3049487216659381, "source": "性", 